# What make_zip leaves out of <project>_export.zip. By default the zip holds every file
# git does not ignore, so .gitignore decides; add patterns here only to leave out
# files the project commits but should not share. This file (.style/zipignore)
# belongs to the project: edit it freely.
# One pattern per line: end a folder with /, * is a wildcard, and start with / to match
# from the project root only (for example /raw_data/ but not example_data/).
# The zip never contains .git, style/, .venv or earlier export zips.
